{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05108","headline":"同李舍人冬日集安乐公主山池 · 沈佺期","name":"同李舍人冬日集安乐公主山池","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尝闻天女贵，家即帝宫连。\n亭插宜春果，山冲太液泉。\n桥低乌鹊夜，台起凤皇年。\n故事犹如此，新图更可怜。\n紫岩妆阁透，青嶂妓楼悬。\n峰夺香炉巧，池偷明镜圆。\n梅花寒待雪，桂叶晚留烟。\n兴尽方投辖，金声还复传。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05108.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05108","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}